  {
    "name": "a folder deleted and made again on one device while another adds to the old one: one merged folder, no 'Data 2'",
    "description": "ICLOUD-008 (a): an app re-created folder Data and iCloud made 'Data 2'. Rules C2 and A3: a new file in a deleted folder survives, the re-created folder is the same folder; no second folder appears.",
    "steps": [
      { "op": "drive_create", "remote": "r2", "encrypted": false },
